# Project Tracker KPI card contract (Notification Engine)

Design reference (read-only, do not merge repos):

`/Users/mohamedaasik/Desktop/Cursor/ProjectTracker/src/ProjectDashboardPage.jsx`

- `PremiumKPICard` — `min-h-[112px] lg:min-h-[168px]`, label + value left, icon right
- `DASHBOARD_CARD_GRID` — `grid grid-cols-2 items-stretch gap-2.5 sm:gap-4 md:gap-5 xl:grid-cols-4`
- Palette: `#2B5AED` `#0084AD` `#22C55E` `#EF4444` `#8B5CF6` `#F97316`

## Rules

- Embed and normal dashboards use the same `EmbedKpiCard` / `NE_KPI_GRID_CLASS`.
- **Always 4-up on xl.** Never `md:grid-cols-3` for 3 or 6 cards — that stretches cards too wide.
- Incomplete last rows stay quarter-width (empty cells OK). Do not grow remaining cards to fill the row.
- Same height and width for every card in the grid. No empty space *inside* a stretched card.
- Do not change scheduled-email KPI logic when restyling cards.
